# Development Workflow

Before every task:

1. Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)
2. Read [docs/current.md](../../docs/current.md)
3. Read [planning/execution/current-sprint.md](../../planning/execution/current-sprint.md)
4. Read the active task in [tasks/](../../tasks/)
5. Read the related [docs/contracts/](../../docs/contracts/)
6. Read the related [docs/specs/](../../docs/specs/)

Only then begin implementation.
